Portions derive from MOTU CueMix 5 (com.motu.CueMix5 / motucuemix5, JavaScript sources whose package.json
declares "license": "Apache-2.0", author "MOTU, Inc."):

  - _motu_mixer/presentation/static/eq_math.js: the EQ coefficient and response math, ported from equi.js
    (EQBand.CalculateCoeff, EQBand.GenerateCurve).
  - The protocol framing, the 7-bit packing, the value types, the property identifiers and table sizes, the
    routing address map and the meter index table documented in PROTOCOL-SPEC.md and used in _motu_mixer/
    (from midi.js, datastore.js, dev_common.js, dev_828.js, mixmgr.js, meterstore.js).

No CueMix source files are redistributed in this repository.
